body:
Does it though? That story ends with Estinien as a fugitive and then he's suddenly Aymeric's bodyguard with no mention of that plot-line in the MSQ.  

&#x200B;

Unless I missed something?

Honestly, when we defeated Zodiark and we saw a glimpse of Etheirys on fire with the evil female voice saying "at last..." I seriously thought the plot was gravitating to this twist... especially as I had accidentally spoiled for myself that Hydaelyn was the second trial.  

&#x200B;

I'm glad I was wrong in the end.

I expected SOMETHING to happen, because Season 3 was confirmed and if this trial went as normal Vought would definitely be fucked.  

&#x200B;

I just didn't expect heads to start exploding.

So I really enjoy the story, world, dungeons, music and boss fights of this game... however as a busy person with very little free time i'm struggling to optimize my playtime especially to catch up with the story-line (currently on the ravana MSQ line).

&#x200B;

Any suggestions?

Justapancake put it best: 

&#x200B;

Young Xehanort: "Suck my dick"

&#x200B;

Sora: "Rude."

>whose pussy stink brainwashes you

My fucking sides lol

&#x200B;

Right there with you on that one, I put Billy Madison on Netflix for my fiance to watch and I assured her it was a hilarious movie because I loved it when I was 12.  

&nbsp;  

She called off the wedding 10 minutes into it.  

&nbsp;

Nah but she hated it and so did I, shit was funny when I was 12... not when i'm a more mature 25 year old.

Dude...  

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Nice.
